Build against the toolchain the builder image and p4a already provide.

AGP defaults ndkVersion to its own bundled version and hard-fails [CXX1100]
when that disagrees with ndkPath, so both have to be set. The Dockerfile pins
the NDK release name while AGP compares the numeric revision, so
make_barcode_scanner.sh reads it out of the NDK's own source.properties
and exports it as ELEC_NDK_VERSION.

The gradle wrapper is pointed at gradle-9.4.1-all, the same distribution p4a's
bootstrap downloads, so the whole build shares one distribution instead of fetching
several, and pinned with distributionSha256Sum so the wrapper verifies it before
executing it. Keep both in sync with p4a's
bootstraps/common/build/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties.

diff --git a/wrappers/aar/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties b/wrappers/aar/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
index 2d3dd298..4e859cd0 100644
--- a/wrappers/aar/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
+++ b/wrappers/aar/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 #Wed Jan 26 11:58:22 CET 2022
 distributionBase=GRADLE_USER_HOME
-distributionUrl=https\://services.gradle.org/distributions/gradle-9.4.1-bin.zip
+distributionUrl=https\://services.gradle.org/distributions/gradle-9.4.1-all.zip
+distributionSha256Sum=708d2c6ecc97ca9a11838ef64a6c2301151b8dd10387e22dc1a12c30557cab5b
 distributionPath=wrapper/dists
 zipStorePath=wrapper/dists
 zipStoreBase=GRADLE_USER_HOME
diff --git a/wrappers/aar/zxingcpp/build.gradle b/wrappers/aar/zxingcpp/build.gradle
index d0e973b1..62044d2b 100644
--- a/wrappers/aar/zxingcpp/build.gradle
+++ b/wrappers/aar/zxingcpp/build.gradle
@@ -6,6 +6,13 @@ plugins {
 android {
 	namespace 'de.markusfisch.android.zxingcpp'
 	compileSdk sdk_version
+	// use the build-tools and NDK installed in the builder image, instead of
+	// letting AGP download its own defaults. AGP validates ndkVersion
+	// against ndkPath, so both must be given; make_barcode_scanner.sh reads
+	// ELEC_NDK_VERSION out of the NDK's own source.properties.
+	buildToolsVersion System.getenv('ANDROID_SDK_BUILD_TOOLS_VERSION')
+	ndkPath System.getenv('ANDROID_NDK_HOME')
+	ndkVersion System.getenv('ELEC_NDK_VERSION')

 	defaultConfig {
 		minSdk 21
